{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は乃木どこ最終回です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん観てくださーい(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"視聴率50%くらい\nいっちゃうかなぁ〜？\n(　・ω・) ♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/04/12/6527767/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花冠を若月に乗せられた(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はなぜか鼻がずーっと\nピクピクしてるの(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんなんだろう？ピクピク"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウサちゃんになった気分です☆\nピクピク"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/04/12/6527767/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんさん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木カフェのレポートを\n運営ブログを乗っ取って書いてて\n見たら行ってみたくなったので\n今度行っちゃおうかなぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は東京ビッグサイトで握手会♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"咳が出ないことを祈ります(っTωT)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週も週末デートですヽ(〃v〃)ﾉきゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいですか〜？♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなったんは...嬉しい♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれる方は1日よろしくねっ(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/04/12/6527767/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなことされてますが\n今日は堀さんに大失態を犯し\nちゃったの(´⊙ω⊙`≡´⊙ω⊙`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お詫びをたくさんしました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度お詫びの続きもします(*´･ω･`)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！先日スタートした\nNOGIBONGO!4観た人〜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4は変身がテーマになっていて\n第1回はまいやんになっちゃおう！\nという企画でした(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その中でなんとざわちんさんに\nまいやんメイクを施して\nいただいてまいやんそっくりに\nしてもらいました♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一瞬だったけどまいやんになれて\n楽しかったです(。-ω-)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女神様はやっぱり美しい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"調子に乗って写真集の裏表紙も\n勝手に真似っこしちゃいましたが\nあれを撮ってる時がすごく\n楽しかったです（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんごめんよ〜(ノω=｀)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもざわちんさんに\nまいやんよりも綾野剛さんのほうが\nすごく似せられる顔をしている！\nと言われてびっくりしました(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか変身してみたいな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回はモデルさん企画です(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はモデルさんからは程遠いですが\nお声がかかればいつでも\n伺える準備はできております(人-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冗談です。\nまた調子に乗りました(´°ω°｀)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎回あらゆる変身を\n代わる代わるメンバーが\n遂げていくのでぜひ\nご覧くださーい(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/04/12/6527767/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写メ撮ろ〜といってカメラを\nちゃんとみてくれることが\nほとんどないいくちゃん(´-ω-｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近755で「真夏とカレー\nどっちが好き？」の質問に\nいろんなメンバーがカレー！\nと答えていて寂しいので\n明日握手会でもちょくちょく\n聞いてみまーす♡♡♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃ、少し短いですがこの辺で(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/04/12/6527767/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひょっ！！"}],"source":"archive"}